                                                    <li>Preparado para mantenerse, ampliarse y adaptarse fácilmente</li>
                                                </ul>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="project-detail-block">
                                        <div class="project-detail-label"><i class="fa fa-cubes"></i> Stack</div>
                                        <div class="tech-tags mt-2">
                                            <span class="tech-tag tech-tag-sm">Python</span>
